## .NET upgrades and vulnerable packages

When asked to upgrade .NET, fix vulnerable or deprecated NuGet packages, or check .NET end-of-life dates,
read and follow `<path-to>/dotnet-eol-guard/SKILL.md` step by step (scan, plan, baseline, upgrade,
build, test, re-scan, report). Do not declare the upgrade done until the re-scan has no critical/high findings.
